Package: ggtrust
Type: Package
Title: Visualizing Point Reliability in Dimensionality Reduction Scatterplots
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ADVT", "Project", email = "advt@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A grammar-of-graphics extension for ggplot2 that visualizes per-point
    spatialization fidelity in dimension-reduction-derived scatterplots (t-SNE, UMAP,
    PCA, MDS). Provides halo and landscape geoms for marking points whose low-dimensional
    position is not a trustworthy reflection of their original-space neighborhood, a
    reliability scale and guide, and statistics computing trustworthiness and continuity
    directly from the original data.
